OL,3,ABatman to James Bond: The clues about
OL,4,Awhat to expect from Robert Pattinson's
OL,5,A007
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I was thinking about what the aspects
OL,8,Fof James Bond are, and he's done all of
OL,9,Fthose throughout his career," says Paul
OL,10,FTweddle, host of the Heavy Spoilers
OL,11,Ffilm podcast.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
